/-!
# Functoriality of the zeroth K-group of a triangulated category

All statements are about the zeroth `K`-group `CategoryTheory.Pretriangulated.K0` of
[Stacks, Tag 0FCN]: its functoriality along exact functors ([Stacks, Tag 0FCQ]), the Euler
characteristic of a homological functor ([Stacks, Tag 0FCR]) and the bilinear map induced by an
exact bifunctor ([Stacks, Tag 0FCT]).

## Main results

* `CategoryTheory.Pretriangulated.K0.cls`, `K0.cls_rel`, `K0.hom_ext`: the class `[X]` of an
  object, the relation imposed by a distinguished triangle, and the extensionality of
  homomorphisms out of `K₀`.
* `CategoryTheory.Pretriangulated.K0.map`, `K0.map_cls`, `K0.map_unique`: [Stacks, Tag 0FCQ].
* `K0_homomorphism_of_homological`: [Stacks, Tag 0FCR].
* `CategoryTheory.Pretriangulated.K0.exists_bilinear_of_bifunctor`: [Stacks, Tag 0FCT].

## References

* [Stacks, Tag 0FCQ](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0FCQ)
* [Stacks, Tag 0FCR](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0FCR)
* [Stacks, Tag 0FCT](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0FCT)
-/

